#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call this \"story\" uh... \"Candy: Delicious and Dead.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Surprise candy! I love surprise candy!"
