#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_noir/11
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oooh... <i>that</i> kinda surprise Candy."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_noir/19
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this one: \"Behold A Pale Asteroid, and his Robot was Death.\""
