#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Haha, ok that was pretty funny!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Now we just need a title that encompasses: noir, robots, dead mistresses, asteroids, and has a comedic tone. Easy, let's call this..."
