#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"It's a Bad, Sad, Plaid-Clad World.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "God, what a hero. I'm tearing up just thinking about his epic sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "We'll never forget you Detective Xander Wen! You were the best of us, brother!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "The only title that will truly do this gut-wrenching story justice is..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_adventure/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Bunker Buddies.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "That's why the asteroid was coming to earth so fast - it wanted to have sex with Xander!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_adventure_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "We still need to title this erotic thriller, so how about: \"Make Mine Meteor.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Silly Fuzz! You're now a felon!"
