#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But we gotta name it anyway, so let's call it: \"The Sexy Fart that Saved the World.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Wow. That was really impactful."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Not just because of the asteroid — but mostly because of the asteroid."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call it: \"Up the Creek With a Paddle.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "They don't make enough erotic apocalyptic fiction, do they? Let's fix that!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_adventure_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And I think a fitting title for this would be: \"The Sex Dungeon at the End of the World.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Damn Xander - good line!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call this slightly sensual detective story: \"Bury Me Twice, Shame on the Mayor.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oh it was Blissmas? Somehow I totally missed that."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I guess we gotta give it a Blissmas-themed title then, yeah? How about..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Sand and Slay Bells.\" Boom nailed it!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I'm sorry... what? What the hell is \"the Xorp homeworld?\" Where'd that come from?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Listen I like a good twist as much as anyone, but not when it's implemented so clumsily."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway let's call it, \"Close Encounters of the Dead Kind.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I'm gonna be honest with you... it's bad."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And I'm weighing the pros and cons of giving myself a concussion to see if I can erase my short-term memory."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_noir_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But before I do that, let's give it a title! I call it, \"The Shoreline Slaughter.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Well <i>that</i> got dark."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_noir/11
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I feel like that one's a little all over the map? But just to be sure we'll bring in a focus group and see what they think."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_noir/19
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "A random sampling of grown adults who have time to participate in a focus group are never wrong about the artistic merits of someone else's creative work."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_noir/27
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And let's call this one, oh let's say... \"A Murder Most Hodge Podge.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Aww... Toby and Mr. Mayor - back together!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Listen, does it have some problems? Sure. But so does the Mona Lisa. It's <i>so</i> small! Why isn't it bigger? It would've been so much better if it was bigger!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Point is, I'm a sucker for a happy ending. Even when I can't necessarily follow how exactly we got there."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_comedy/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But I still think people are going to love, \"The Father, the Son, and the Holey Plot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "<i>Holy crap.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "So the mayor murdered his mistress... and used the pretext of wanting to reunite with his estranged son as a way to flee to Cuba? What a twist!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "The criminal mind is so fascinating."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_adventure/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, honestly, is yours..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_adventure/32
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call it: \"Havana Pop-turn.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And maybe instead of having our readers get to that sudden airplane stripping moment, we just instruct them to stop reading right before it happens."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I'm sure they'll love the rest of: \"Gone with the Murder.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "My opinion? It's got some inconsistencies."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "However: that ending? Wow. Now <i>that's</i> what good noir is all about."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_noir/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Sometimes it's easier to just let the corpses explode and destroy all the evidence than to actually solve the murder."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_noir/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Is it unsatisfying? Absolutely. But it's raw. It's gritty. It's <i>real.</i> And a story that visceral needs a great title, like..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_noir/32
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Beach Bodies Go Boom Boom.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Wait what?! lol. \"Raise the orphaned bomb as their very own??\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "God damnit."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "That's so, so stupid. I love it."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_comedy/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And I've even got the perfect title..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_comedy/32
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Three Men and a Bomby\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "The President huh?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Feels like a little bit of a cop out."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Ooo I actually like that for a title though! \"Cop Out.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_adventure/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call it that. It's accurate."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Haha, that was a great pun!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But we weren't trying to come up with a great pun — we were trying to come up with a great <i>story.</i> And I think we just blew up any chance of that."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "See? I can make puns too."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_adventure_erotic/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this one: \"Here Today: Exploded Tomorrow\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Amazing! So Fuzz used his robotic sensuality to entrap the Mayor. What a twist!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And there's definitely a hole in the market for robotic erotic thrillers, so I think this'll do gangbusters!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_noir/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "We just need a catchy title. How about: \"Blood for Murder. Oil for Pleasure.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Uh oh! A couple stranded on a cruise with the robot's evangelical parents? Sounds like the makings of a hilarious rom-com!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Actually, no shade on the book idea we just finished, but the cruise concept sounds way funnier."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's just publish that instead. We'll get an advance from the publisher based off the pitch and write it after."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_comedy/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oh and let's call it: \"Over Circuitboard.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Huh. Ok."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "So like... the Mayor actually worked for the President the whole time? I guess?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I mean technically mayors <i>do</i> work for the government — and the President is the head of the government."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_adventure/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But the division between federal and state government means it's not a true hierarchical system."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_adventure/32
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "However... the sex was hot and frankly that's all that really matters."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_adventure/40
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call it, \"Avenge my Death, Metal-Daddy.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I like it. It's solid."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Slap a half-naked robot detective on the cover and someone on the internet will be churning out erotic fanfic in no time."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_noir_erotic_erotic_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And let's call it, \"The Hand that Rocks the Robot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Incredible! He couldn't hack the NASPLAQUE, so the cops hacked him up."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "In the \"industry\" we call that \"poetic justice.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_noir/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oooh hey, let's also call the book that!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, in a shocking twist Fuzz was promoted to President of the United States. It was a confusing and frankly lazy ending to: \"Hacks! And <i>Not</i> Just the Computer Kind.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "So this is more a 'cartel-origin story', which we can continue in the next book. The first one will be called: \"I, (The Cartel Infiltrating) Robot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "<i>Yikes.</i> What a dark twist. Guess in the end Fuzz couldn't \"hack it\", huh? Get it?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "GET IT?!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_noir_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this future mini-series that gets cancelled after three episodes... \"Can't Hack Love.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oh poor Fuzz... can't help the way he's programmed! Let's call this sad tale: \"Debugged and De-hugged.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I can see the generational rifts being played out at the dinner table between heaping servings of servo-rotors! Let's call this awkward family reunion: \"Chrome-ancing the Stone.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oh man, I'm already pumped for the sequel! And I usually <i>hate</i> sequels. And yet... I oddly love quadrilogies."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, that's something for me to discuss with my therapist — along with our new best seller: \"Oops I Committed a Federal Crime!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Wishful thinking, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's title this masterpiece: \"Wait What Were We Talking About Again?\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Xander meets him in jail and confronts him about stealing the main character status from him. Readers are gonna maybe love: \"The Fantabulously Brief Adventures of Robotic Man!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Awww. A heartwarming rom-com that teaches us that absolutely everyone deserves love... as long as they're a billionaire with superpowers. Let's title it: \"We All Die Alone.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Fuzz finds Atlantis a few weeks later in the ruins of an abandoned gumball machine factory. Who knew? Anyway, let's title this one: \"Chew on This.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Fuzz forced his throbbing tongue into Xander Wen's eager mouth. It was a disgusting end to a disgusting story that I'm calling: \"La Dolce Robota.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as punishment for his crimes, Fuzz was sentenced to 25 years of community service. Which all things considered was a pretty reasonable end to: \"Are You There Sexy Plumber? It's me, Robot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Who the hell is Gerald Dabrowski? Anyway, let's call this mess: \"Gerald Dabrowski and the Sexy Robot Heist\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as a rampaging Doomzilla laid waste to Downtown Sprawlsville, Fuzz stared in unmitigated horror. After all, he'd just stolen some property there."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"Stealing Sexy Stocks and a Kaiju I Guess?\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_noir_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Boy everyone just keeps <i>appearing</i> in this book. And having sex. Oh well, let's call it: \"This Appearing Act.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, betrayed by his beloved, Fuzz spent the rest of his days rotting in prison. It was a tragic end to our future award winner... \"Secrets Buried in the Hard Drive\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was the greatest twist ending anyone had ever written. Way better than the movie with the dumb ending with the kid who sees ghosts. And it even had a much better title: \"Enzo Stereotypo: Mobster of Multitudes.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so it did: the moon crashed right into the Earth. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Interesting! What was your inspiration? A rotting pile of garbage?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But we gotta name it so let's go with, \"The Moon that Ruined the Wedding.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Fuzz and Unit 14J made hot, hot love. Unfortunately it was hotter than their cooling systems could handle, and the lovers exploded in the most powerful orgasm of all time."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which I hope book lovers everywhere will have while reading this masterpiece of fiction, \"You Can't Hurry Love: Unless You're a Robot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, in a shocking twist that surprised everyone, Unit 14J had Fuzz arrested for his crimes. Thus proving once and for all that robots make terrible girlfriends, no matter what the internet says."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"The Robot Viscount Switcheroo.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so Fuzz & Unit 14J joyously spent the rest of their lives together."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which was like 4 years — give or take. They were designed with planned obsolescence."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a slapstick, heart-warming, romantic comedy. Great work! Even though you totally sidelined Detective Xander Wen."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy/24
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But that is kinda funny actually."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy/32
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's title it, \"Robotically Ever After.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But it was too late. The tsunami crashed into the wedding, instantly washing everyone away. It was a stark reminder of the cruelness of existence, and that destination weddings are a terrible idea."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anywho, let's title this: \"The Love Circuit.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Definitely start going into credit card debt ASAP, ‘cause everyone's going to love, \"Happily Ever Algorithm.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, an enraged Brent dismembered Fuzz. Which sounds extremely graphic, but Fuzz was a robot so it wasn't really that big of a deal. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Wow. Twistier than a pretzel and twice as German. Let's call this future best-seller, \"Liar Liar Circuits on Fire.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Brent ultimately agreed to stand aside. For in the end, he believed that nothing should ever come between true love."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Not even divorce. Because Brent's views on the topic were disturbing and outdated. Unlike our story: \"Nothing Binary About Love.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And in a violent blast, Fuzz exploded... horribly scarring Brent. In fact nothing could possibly scar him more, except maybe if he had read our terrible book: \"The Lies That Robots Tell.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so the duo made sweet, sweet love all night long. It was both extremely hot and very confusing, much like the conclusion to our story, which I'm calling: \"Someone's Gettin' Boned Tonight.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was the worst ending imaginable. Not just for the individual characters, but also from a general quality perspective. But we gotta title it so let's go with, \"Tie the Bot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Fuzz magically grew 20 feet in height, Brent stared in stunned silence. Clearly appalled — yet unable to look away."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which I imagine is what most reviewers will say about this dreck."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's title it: \"Hot, Sweaty Circuits.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Oh no! There's something about the phrase 'naked and glistening in oil' that seems to always attract Somali pirates."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call this adventurous tale: \"High Seize!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Unit 14J writhed between her two ravishing lovers, she realized she was about to have the best night of her life."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which also applies to anyone reading our masterpiece: \"Speak Now or Forever Hold Your Robot.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as the bullet pierced Xander's skull — and Doomzilla awakened from its watery slumber — Fuzz realized: his world would never be the same again. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_noir_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's title it: \"Love in the Time of Kaiju\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Shakespeare would be proud! And he can't refute that because he's dead. Let's call this one, \"Circuits of the Heart.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, an enraged Doomzilla descended upon the wedding, violently killing everything in its path. It was a horrific and super cool conclusion to: \"Something Old, Something New, Something Robotic, Something Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Now to be fair, having sex with a kaiju definitely wasn't part of Fuzz's original plan. But this was a story about life, and frankly life is a bewildering mishmash of pointless tangents."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Much like our story, which I'm calling: \"You Invited Doomzilla?!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, in a stunning turn of events, Fuzz arrested the baby kaiju for an unsolved murder from 1982. And although DNA evidence was inconclusive, the jury nevertheless found the baby kaiju guilty and sentenced it to life in prison."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a shocking spectacle, much like this story, which I'm calling: \"Much Ado About Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so Fuzz and the baby kaiju switched bodies. It was a shocking twist that ensured this story would go up in the pantheon of incredible literary works. Let's title it, \"Eat, Pray, Raise a Baby Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Of course the baby kaiju didn't need a machete to overthrow a government: it was a kaiju. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a wild ride! I know critic's will just love: \"Raising Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Spicy! You can really feel your influence all over this one. Not mine."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "This one's all you."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call it, \"Doomzilla Shrugged.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Doomzilla was arrested for property damage and murder. Bizarrely, the D.A. couldn't make the murder charges stick, but in the end it didn't really matter. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Amazing! Let's call this sure-to-be classic, \"Going to the Chapel and We're Gonna Get Crushed to Death.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Robot, human, and monster detective team-up? Wowsers! I really hope this gets an audio book; I wanna hear Tray Chase voice Doomzilla in: \"Four Weddings and a Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "All the best books end with an unmotivated mission to Mars; that's indisputable. So I'm sure the public is going to go crazy for: \"The Kaiju that Crushed my Maid of Honor.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Fuzz made furious, animalistic love to the kaiju. Which probably should've been illegal, but it also should've been impossible because how did it fit through the doorway?"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_adventure_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What's important however is that it was very hot, and a thrilling conclusion to: \"I Will Always Love Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And even though Fuzz had coaxed Doomzilla to the surface, he apparently had decided to shoot it dead. Reminding us that in the end, all motivations are ultimately unknowable and convoluted. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I love it! And although my taste is questionable, I think \"Fifty Shades of Kaiju\" is going to do bonkers!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so it was, that Doomzilla the Kaiju became CEO of the most successful corporation in human history: Amalgamated Cultivators and Pork Fat. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Incredible! Your mind is like a steel trap! A very rusty steel trap. Anyway, let's call this, \"Sexy Scales: A Kaiju Love Story.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as the volcano erupted around them, Fuzz took solace that at least he wouldn't die alone. Which is more than most senior citizens can say. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I love it! Let's call it: \"Hold Me Closer, Giant Kaiju.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was the absolute correct response to a scantily-clad kaiju, and let's face it any of you would have done the exact same."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which is why I know everyone will love our story: \"The Kaiju Sutra.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a fate that Fuzz had long done his best to avoid. But fate is a fickle thing. Much like cats and the economy. And also how I feel about this story, which I'm gonna call: \"I'd Do Anything for Love: Including That.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Fuzz proceeded to dog-sit Xander's hilarious talking Rottweiler, Chunky, for the weekend. However, Chunky's \"hilarity\" had been somewhat exaggerated... which frankly was a big let down."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Much like this story. Let's call it: \"Crimes of the CPU.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Unfortunately, Xander was woefully unprepared to lead an expedition to the Titanic. The two were never heard from again, a conclusion that people were kinda split on."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which I imagine will also be the reaction to this story. Let's title it, \"The Cost of Seduction: Surprisingly High.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Surprised Xander didn't know that before, but also surprised that Xander became District Attorney in a matter of minutes."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Honestly I don't think this works as a novel... but it'd make a <i>great</i> manifesto! Let's call it, \"Unhinged Rantings of a Crazy Person.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Fuzz was arrested for indecent exposure, which seemed unfair considering he was a robot. It was a painful reminder how unjust the legal system can be, and how gross it is to imagine our parents having sex."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's title this one, \"Bare Naked Robots.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "That's what you're going with huh? Boy I wish I had your confidence! Let's title this one, \"Me and My Time-Traveling Robot Parents.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "As a novel: this kinda sucks. But as a product to induce vomiting... it's a goldmine! And I know just what to title it, \"The Resistance Bled Oil.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as they made sweet, sweet robot love, Fuzz couldn't help but wonder... why the hell his parents were still in the room. It was a terrible predicament, but not as terrible as our story... \"What a Robot'll Do for Love.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so the T-Rex was arrested for property damage. His sentence? Death by lethal injection. The punishment was needlessly horrific, but frankly so was this story, which I'm gonna call: \"Jurassic Wedding: Audiobook Narrated by Crisp Rat.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And in a hilarious turn of events, the T-Rex agreed to be Fuzz's date for the wedding. It was the start of a beautiful, if atypical, romance — reminding us all that love can come from the most unlikely of places. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call this one, \"The Dinosaur that Came to the Wedding.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, the T-Rex joined Fuzz's nascent ghost hunting squad, which ultimately didn't make a lot of sense. Frankly neither did this story, but I'm still gonna give it a sick title like: \"Pararobotical Activity.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And to the surprise of no one, Fuzz and the T-Rex engaged in sweaty, throbbing love-making all night long. It was a sexy and disgusting conclusion to the story I'm calling: \"Ooh Yeah: That's the Spot Dino Daddy!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Nice! Xander Wen puts the cuffs on his bewildered partner in: \"Sex, Betrayal, and Robots.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And even though Fuzz didn't know if he was ready to be the dad to quintuplets, he took solace in the fact that their childhoods would be very difficult to mess up. As they were robots and therefore not technically alive. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Hilarious! Bookworms everywhere are going to love, \"Accidentally Robo-Daddy!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "There wouldn't be much time to form a new government, but Fuzz was used to doing things in a slapdash fashion. Much like how we wrote this story, which I'm calling: \"Rebel Fun: Fuzz Story (With Xander Wen).\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_comedy_erotic_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, through the power of his metallic phallus, Fuzz had triumphantly wooed back the robot of his dreams. It was cause for celebration, and also the sexy conclusion to: \"Do Robots Dream of Electric Sex?\"The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Dam! I mean... damn! Xander's one tough detective. Hopefully readers will not be totally scared by him in: \"Sank You Very Much.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander and Debra remained handcuffed together for the next six hours. It resulted in many hilarious hijinks that honestly undercut the severity of the situation at the hydroelectric plant. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's title it: \"Gleb Hor-what-now?\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Ok... so he handcuffed her to a killer robot from the future? Yeah yeah definitely one of the choices you could choose! Whatever, let's call this: \"Nuke It Before It Lays Eggs.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And although Horvat the terrorist managed to successfully blow up the hydroelectric plant, Xander was too busy humping to care. Thus the city of Sprawlsville was destroyed, ensuring there would be no sequel to: \"Nuclear Sex with my Nuclear Ex.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Debra was being shanked, Horvat the terrorist managed to successfully blow up the hydroelectric plant. It was a terrible tragedy, but not as terrible as this story, which I'm gonna call: \"The Nutty Transgressor.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Debra face-planted into a cactus farm. It was a hilarious end to an otherwise pretty serious story, that I'm calling: \"A Prickly Situation.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Debra began her lunar journey, back on Earth Horvat the terrorist managed to successfully blow up the hydroelectric plant. A tragic conclusion to: \"Journey to the Center of the Moon.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Debra grabbed a whip and assless chaps, she wondered: \"Hey, whatever happened to that terrorist attack at the hydroelectric plant?\" She never did get an answer, but neither did readers of our story: \"Xander's Magical Goo.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which is why you can never trust monkeys. <i>Ever.</i> Anyway, let's call this: \"Monkey See, Monkey Doom.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, being an embryo, Xander was powerless to stop Gleb Horvat from blowing up the hydroelectric plant. But given that he wasn't encased in an amniotic sac, all his other troubles were frankly pretty irrelevant. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Lotta concerning choices! But since it's what we got, let's call it: \"When You Wish Upon a Nuke.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I... don't know what to say."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I'm having trouble figuring this out..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "We're gonna need to write another book to explain this book that we'll call: \"Xander's Paradox.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander was instantly devoured by a pack of sexy cannibals. Thus proving once and for all that monkeys can never be trusted."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_adventure_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"Be Careful What you Nuke For.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander proved once and for all why edible panties are the most potent weapon in the fight against terrorism. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call this: \"The Edible Panties that Saved America.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander invited Debra to join his G&G group. It was indeed a surprise, but not nearly as surprising as when Horvat inevitably blew up the hydroelectric plant."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was also less surprising than what I decided to name this story: \"Dungeons and Terrorists.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, with his newly acquired superpowers, Xander successfully stopped Horvat from destroying the hydroelectric plant. He was awarded many prestigious medals, which I also hope to receive for our thrilling story, entitled: \"The Nuclear Horror Picture Show.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, immersed in frothing, erotic ecstasy, Xander didn't even notice as Gleb Horvat blew up the hydroelectric plant. But frankly, Xander had never been very observant anyway. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_noir_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"Wet Hot American Nuclear Holocaust.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a reference that would've killed in 1993, but it wasn't 1993 and Xander wasn't a big movie buff anyway."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "He preferred podcasts, and reading books like this one, which I'm gonna call: \"A Canticle for Kasparian.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Not sure people are going to get that last reference, but it would've <i>killed</i> in June 2024. Anyway let's title this: \"A Crime Best Served Nuked.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was true: Katie would definitely miss the autopsy at Area 51. It was a horrific tragedy, kinda like this story, which I'm calling: \"Influence This.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Well, there was time for one last fling in the cop car... but let's have the book end there to extend the mystery."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Not sure this one's for me, but I also thought \"Hamlet\" was overrated so who knows."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_noir_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's title this: \"Hamlet 2!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a brilliant marketing ploy. And even though she was forever labeled a terrorist, Katie had successfully become the most followed influencer on Earth."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And Xander? Well Xander was fired for letting the real terrorist blow up the power plant. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_noir/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "So many twists! Not sure if that's a good thing, but we'll let the readers be the judge of... \"The Influencer Who Nuked Her Career.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Katie agreed to an exhibition match against Bunt Fistigrant. She lost horribly, but gained millions in free publicity in the process. It was a sad commentary on the state of our culture, but a hilarious ending to our story: \"Apocalypse Trending.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "As the concept of literature, I totally get that reference."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "In fact, let's title this story: \"Heart of Viral-ness.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And it worked! By livestreaming hot, ravenous sex with Xander her follower account increased exponentially."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Of course this was a purely fictional scenario, as no celebrity would ever intentionally release a sex tape to build a following."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_comedy_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anywho, let's title this: \"Followers and Fallout.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Forget it, Kate. It's Ragnarök.\" Xander grumbled. A thrilling conclusion to our masterpiece: \"A Hazy Shade of Nuclear Winter.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Aw man. This is totes gonna ruin Spring Break, brah!\" Xander declared, concluding the best mash-up since the cronut!"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call this masterpiece: \"The Influencer Who Ruined Ragnarök.\""
