msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which was very entertaining <i>and</i> accurate to Norwegian mythology. Let's call this: \"The Influencer Who Came to Ragnarök.\""
