#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Amazing! You really captured how the average person would react to the end of the world, <i>if</i> they were a detective with a social media star. Let's call this: \"From Horn to Horny.\""
