#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Awesome! And there's definitely a hole in the market for erotic thrillers about terrorists, so I think this'll do gangbusters! Let's call it: \"The Influencer, the Terrorist, and Me.\""
