#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Yep sure! Let's call this sudden novel: \"Horvat and the Melodic Meltdowns.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, given that Xander was distracted by having sex, Horvat used the opportunity to nuke the power plant. It was a stark warning to teenagers in abstinence-only sex ed classes everywhere. The End."
