#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's title it: \"Don't Do Sex, Kids.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_comedy_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Horvat joined them in a fiery threesome: a stark reminder of the power of love to overcome hate. Or something. Anyway, let's title it: \"A Song of Soggy and Fire.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Horvat was sentenced to death. Luckily for him however, the death penalty was abolished before he could be executed."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was an extremely contentious issue, and a morally provocative conclusion to our masterpiece: \"Don't Mess with the GSA.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a true assertation: Horvat was way hotter in his dating profile. But we all age, and it's important that we're able to be comfortable and confident with our true appearance."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And that's the message I hope readers will take away from: \"Hor<i>vat</i>-fishing.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I always knew Ms. Jackson was an angel! Too bad she's one of destruction."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this: \"The Talented Mr. Horvat.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Hope you like your toes sucked, you virile smokeshow.\" Ms. Jackson cooed. Lucky for her, Xander did. And as the sucking commenced, Xander smiled proudly. The End."
