#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"GSA: Gentle Sexual Administration.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so Xander did: he slept with one eye open the rest of his life. Which was actually much easier than he anticipated it would be. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What an exciting tale! Let's call this: \"The Terrorist's Mother.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as the laughter of the studio audience echoed throughout the power plant, Xander laughed too. Because laughter, as you know, is infectious."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Thus concludes our hilarious tale: \"How I Met Hor's Mother.\""
