#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was true: the siren's song swirled eerily in the wind that night. But Xander dared not be tempted by their enticing melody..."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Because it was a Tuesday, and he had work in the morning."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway let's title this: \"Never Set Sail on a Tuesday.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a vindictive declaration as barbed as it was alluring, and all-in-all a thrilling conclusion to our story: \"How to Stop a Terrorist in 10 Easy Steps.\""
