#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Unfortunately, the show was cancelled after one season, forcing her to return to a humdrum life of terrorism. For show business is a fickle mistress with no loyalty or sympathy for anyone. The End."
