#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, a sheepish and embarrassed Horvat quickly disappeared into the night. A hilarious conclusion to: \"The Naughty Li'l Terrorist.\""
