#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as the elvish forces invaded, Xander breathed a welcome sigh of relief. The tide was finally turning, and soon a new day would dawn. The End."
