#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"What the Elvish Is Going On?\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_adventure_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Xander aggressively spanked Horvat's throbbing cheeks, Horvat's desire to nuke the power plant melted away. Thus concluding our masterpiece: \"Makes You Wish for a Nuclear Winter.\""
