#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was the battle cry that propelled Xander to victory. And rejuvenated by its power, he was able to finally stop Horvat, thus concluding our epic story: \"A Nuke For All Seasons.\""
