#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, in a stunning and humorous turn of events, Horvat agreed to be Xander's date to his sister's destination wedding. It was a hilarious and befuddling conclusion to: \"My Friend Horvat.\""
