#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a shocking twist that no one ever saw coming. Mostly because the authors hadn't done any amount of foreshadowing. Nevertheless, I think readers will love: \"Slaughterhouse-Vibe.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"I want to feel you inside me!\" Xander wailed, and a breathless Horvat was only too happy to oblige him. Thus ended \"My Sexy Terrorist,\" the worst love story ever told."
