#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this: \"Dazed and Accused.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "The prank on the band was that their town was flooded by a bombing of the nearby dam! Let's title this: \"10 Things I Hate About Nukes.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, after being expelled for trying to hijack a prisoner transport plane, Xander and Misty agreed to never go undercover as teenagers ever again. It was an unusual and confusing conclusion to our story: \"To All the Boys I've Nuked Before.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "There'll be no canoodling on our watch! Let's call this wildly divergent story: \"21 Hump Street.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a twist! Everyone knows that when a warrant is in an urn, you earn yourself a warrant."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "In fact, let's call it: \"Warrant Peace.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, the manic genie inundated the duo with pop culture references. Because nothing makes audiences happier than an endless sludge of fan service and nostalgia."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Speaking of, let's title this: \"The Re-Urn of the King.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Two tickets to Mars! Wow! It was a wonderful surprise, and simultaneously a disappointingly unmotivated conclusion to: \"The Terrorist's Accomplice Goes to Mars.\""
