#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And even though it was only supposed to be enough lube to satiate them for an hour, somehow it lasted for eight whole days. And that my friends, was the true miracle of the story of: \"Lube-ukkah.\""
