#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Of course, framing a senator for murder was only something Xander could imagine... not something he'd ever do."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Mostly because he wasn't clever enough to successfully execute something like that."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_noir/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's title this twisty mystery: \"There's Something About Misty.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But could he imagine a six-star chef who is also a talking rat?"
