#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_comedy/27
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And we'll call it: \"What the Fuck Are We Even Doing!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And while Xander was unsure of how many people would get that reference, he still thought it was a pretty good joke. And moreso, it was a solid conclusion to our story: \"Can't Stand Nuking You.\""
