#: lyric_literature/comedy_adventure_erotic_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"Every Little Nuke She Drops is Magic.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Shrug was sentenced to life in prison, and Larry Aruba never held another orgy. Mostly because he was dead."
