#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Now why the Ark of the Covenant cleared Shrug of the crime wasn't exactly clear. But given that the Ark was a direct line to God, Xander opted not to mess with any of that shit. The End."
