#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_noir_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Lotta curious choices there, sport! Anyway, let's call it: \"Xander Wen and the Orgy of Doom.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Amazing! And you captured the private dalliances of billionaires so accurately for a poor person! Let's call this: \"Dick and Shrug's Infinite Orgy.\""
