#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Robbie was arrested for the murder of Larry Aruba. Ultimately however he was cleared of any wrongdoing, as there was absolutely no evidence connecting him to the crime."
