#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Hmm. Although there's definitely some logical flaws — there's no denying that a dragon would be the best transportation for the fabulous Mr. Draymond. Anyway, let's call this: \"The Last Orgy Dragon.\""
