#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander and Robbie engaged in the steamiest, most passionate love-making either had ever experienced. It was a scandalous and arousing conclusion to: \"The Ultimate Fanfic.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as Xander scraped the Tentacle's splattered remains off the pavement, he vowed to protect the innocent orgies of Sprawlsville: forever. The End."
