#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Wow! What a story! Let's title it: \"Never Invite a Terrorist to Your Orgy.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And although the Tentacle had been destroyed, so had the world's largest gelatin mold. It was a stark reminder that great victory requires great sacrifice — and that gelatin is a disappointing dessert."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Almost as disappointing as this story, which I'm gonna call: \"Gelatinous Rube.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And while the Tentacle's death was super epic, it was really too bad Darius the Dragon hadn't been introduced until now."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "He was a really cool character who readers probably would've loved and man the dialogue he had! 10/10."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, thus concludes our story: \"A Most Delicious Orgy Guest.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Incredibly poignant and heartfelt. I don't wanna jinx it, but I think \"Two Drones Doin' It\" could be the great American novel of this generation."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, the mystery of Larry Aruba's mysterious death was finally solved, and Xander Wen disappeared back into the desolate streets of Sprawlsville, haunted by his relentless PTSD. The End."
