#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"The Mystery of the Subpar Orgy.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a shocking twist that Xander never saw coming. In fact, he was honestly a little embarrassed he missed all the clues."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander disappeared back into the night, his entire sense of self shattered... forever. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Fantastic! Let's call this story: \"Fake-kink Your Death.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But it was too late. The tornado obliterated Larry's mansion, all the suspects, and any hope of solving the mystery of Larry's death."
