#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"The Tornado What Ruined the Orgy.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander and Fuzz continued to interrogate Vixen long into the night. And even though it eventually became clear she didn't kill Larry, they certainly didn't mind the overtime. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_noir_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Ooo, baby! Let's call this grade-A erotica: \"I Find You Guilty: Of Being Too Sexy.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_noir_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Amazing! That story had more switchbacks than Lysevegen road in Norway! Look it up."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_noir_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And let's title this: \"Xander's Shameful Secret.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Haha, it's true! There's no better way to clear a party."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this: \"Xander Clears a Party.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_noir_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander reversed time using his time-reversal powers, ensuring he had never arrested himself. However in doing so, he also inadvertently erased his surprise party from existence, which was a tragic ending to: \"The Xand Before Time.\""
