#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_noir_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, like all of Xander's other parties, this one too turned into an orgy. Which is why I've decided to call this story: \"One Way or Another We're Having an Orgy.\""
