#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was true, Randy did kick Chunky out of the yacht rock trio. Not because of his insurance fraud, but because Chunky had committed the greatest crime of all: singing off-key. The End."
