#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_comedy_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! Let's call it: \"Chunky and the Serenading Sailors.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Which was true, the Apocalypse was imminent, but Chunky had forgotten one thing: the law never rests... even during the Apocalypse. It was a stunning and somewhat disjointed conclusion to a story I'm calling: \"The Dog Who Talked Through the Apocalypse.\""
