#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What a story! I'm gonna call it: \"Chunky's Questionable Priorities.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so that's just what Xander did. And although dismembering corpses for the mob was fun, he never forgot the joy of being a detective. It was a joy present in every word of our story: \"So You Arrested the President.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so that's just what Xander did. And even though it was a terrible job, it wasn't as terrible as this story: \"10 Reasons Never to Visit Marion, Ohio.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/comedy_erotic_comedy_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
