msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_noir_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And with Mr. Tummy's help, Hunky's team of unlicensed super friends saved the Earth from lots of aliens and evil billionaires and some dude named Morga-Morgatron."
