#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_noir_adventure_adventure/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call it: \"Heroes Without a License.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_noir_adventure_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And which half was the human half you may ask?"
