#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_noir_adventure_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway let's call this: \"A Hunk and His Faun Get It On.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_noir_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Unfortunately for the duo, flushing evidence of criminal activity was strictly against airline regulations."
