#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_noir_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Aw hell, you crushed my testicles!\" a distraught Hunky howled. And thus a new, hilarious (and highly licensable) catchphrase was born. The End."
