#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, overcome with pimptastic vibes, Xander packed his sweet keytar and some sick wah pedals and headed out for the dopest five days he'd ever experience."
