#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Now, can't say all these threads line up exactly, but whatcha gonna do? We're writing this on spec after all. Let's call this: \"Flowers for Hunky Man.\""
