#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, the mayor was sentenced to 25 years in a supermax upstate, where — in an ironic twist — the only entertainment available was the series adaptation of Xander's blog."
