#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Love it! This might require some light editing — and also some very heavy editing — but in the end I think readers will appreciate: \"Forgetfulness and the City.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Hunky and his wacky community college study group proceeded to have six seasons worth of memorable antics..."
