#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I mean, six <i>chapters'</i> worth."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Let's call this definitely a book: \"McCoymmunity.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander and Hunky proceeded to steal the crown jewels. Which was very illegal but also very cool and shiny."
