#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Amazing! Critics may not like it but remember, \"To Catch a Hunk\" isn't for the critics."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Hunky!\" a swollen Xander moaned, \"These pleasures you are showing me are beyond my wildest imagination!\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And Hunky smiled, knowing his days as a sugar baby were only just beginning."
