#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_comedy_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "What an inspired genre blend! Right up there with Tex-Mex and Irish-Tex-Mex. Let's call it: \"Blog Me All Night Long.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_adventure_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Unfortunately, due to partial R&D funding from the government, Hunky's brain was indeed now federal property... and his journey as a clandestine spy had only just begun."
