#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "A beginning — a middle — <i>AND</i> an end?! That's a story right there, baby! Let's call it: \"They Saved Hunky's Brain!\""
