#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Immediately the two erupted in uproarious laughter! Some say they're still laughing to this very day. But they're wrong."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "<i>Dead wrong.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_adventure_comedy/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "I think this is great... of course we'll need to review the opinions of a bunch of anonymous clickbait trolls to know for sure! But let's call it: \"How Hunky Got His Brains Back.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It was a prophecy that would prove horrifyingly true. For over the next decade Hunky diligently replaced every bone, artery, and organ with a synthetic equivalent."
