#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_erotic_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, no longer able to fulfill his duties as a detective, Xander spent the rest of his days as Hunky's live-in maid. Luckily, the pay was commensurate and Hunky even matched Xander's HSA contributions."
