#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Not sure people are going to get that last reference, but it would've <i>killed</i> in 1997. Anyway let's title this: \"Mrs. Sparkle.\""
