#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_erotic_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "A surprisingly reasonable amount. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_comedy_erotic_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "It's not terrible! But it's also not... what's the word... uh... readable. Anyway, let's call it: \"Wen Xander Wore Stilettos.\""
