#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_noir_noir/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Ok! It's not that I \"hate\" it, so much as... \"I feel dumber having been exposed to it.\" But let's call it: \"Simulate This.\""
