#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_noir_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander and the mob boss spent the next 24 hours learning to krump."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_noir_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And since all the best books end with an unmotivated krumping montage, I'm sure the public is going to go crazy for: \"We Gotta Kill the Don: for Science.\""
