#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_noir_erotic/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "But, it <i>did</i> prove unequivocally that Xander was in a simulation. Let's call it: \"The Moistfather.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_noir/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, Xander was arrested for tax fraud and sentenced to a prison just for furries — which was very progressive. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Honestly, I'd rather read my own obituary. But since we gotta name it let's call it: \"The Purrfect Crime.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, having been neutered, Xander proceeded to sue the animal shelter for malpractice, and in the end won a handsome four figure settlement. The End."
