#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "So: I think this is a mess. However... that end had me in stitches — just like Xander after being neutered! Let's call it: \"Furry-osa: A Xander Wen Saga.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And the sentient AI exterminated everyone who was ever in this book. Which frankly was the right call."
