#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Anyway, let's call this: \"Furminator, Too.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_comedy_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And so, bored of pleasuring himself, Xander finally returned to his human existence... but he never, ever forgot how to lick his own junk."
