#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_adventure_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Marvelous! I can't wait for high school students everywhere to hate being forced to read: \"The Bae-trix\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_adventure_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Sure hope I can use tough love to get those high schoolers to reach their potential!\" Xander sighed, and set off to do just that. The End."
