#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_adventure_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Huh. Interesting choices... but that's what pushes culture forward, am I right? Anyway, let's call it: \"The Bae-trix: Reloaded.\""
