#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_adventure_adventure/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And as the nazi occult monsters raced towards him, Xander smiled deviously: he was going to enjoy this. On account of his bloodlust."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_adventure_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Now that was a curveball! I think? Honestly, I've never actually played hockey. Anyway, let's call this: \"The Bae-trix: Revolutions.\""
