#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_adventure_erotic/16
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "This left a bad taste in my mouth, but I probably shouldn't have been eating the pages. Honestly that's on me, not our masterpiece: \"The Bae-trix: Resurrections.\""
