#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_erotic_noir/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "And like a rollercoaster at a condemned theme park, readers are going to be thrilled by — and gravely concerned about — \"Xander Wen Blows His Wad.\""
