#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_erotic_comedy/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"Bazinga!\" Xander exclaimed. The End."
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_erotic_comedy/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Well, I've read children's letters to Santa with more depth. Anyway, we'll leave it up to the readers to decide the fate of: \"The Big 'O' Theory.\""
