#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_erotic_adventure/8
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "Huh. The ending kinda confused me... but honestly, ever since the massive head trauma I get confused super easily. Anyway, let's call it: \"Hunky McCoy Was Never Real.\""
msgstr ""

#: lyric_literature/erotic_noir_adventure_erotic_erotic/0
msgctxt "Lyric"
msgid "\"I can see God!\" Xander shrieked as the ecstasy exploded from every orifice. And as the waves of pleasure finally subsided he smiled, for he alone knew whether our universe was a simulation or not."
